From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] hg5585f: fix WED GDM mapping and probe cleanup

Fix HG5585F GDM port indexing so the GDM4 LAN1 netdev does not
block WED GDM3. Keep managed device links under driver-core ownership,
report failures with debug disabled, and run a focused probe regression.

